          "type": "p",
          "text": "Israeli food you'll find on any menu: **פָלָאפֶל** *(falafel)*, **שָׁוַארְמָה** *(shawarma)*, **סַבִּיךְ** *(sabikh — pita stuffed with eggplant and egg)*, **שַׁקְשׁוּקָה** *(shakshukah — eggs cooked in tomato sauce)*, and **בּוֹרֶקַס** *(borekas — savory pastries)*."
